      "observed": "U1 PB1 (NET0006) drives Q3 through R1, controlling Q2 and the fan supply, and also reaches J9 pin 4 (NET0012) through R4. Thus the fan PWM/control pin and the fan power-switch control are not independent.",
      "expected": "For the four-pin fan interface shown, keep the fan PWM input independently controllable from the switched supply, or leave that input unused if only supply switching is intended. A shared signal makes the fan supply switch and PWM input operate together rather than providing independent control.",
