          "page": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "an ATtiny-driven fan controller",
          "page": "Repository overview, Atmel/"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The controller cannot independently switch fan power and command fan speed through the fan control pin; PWM activity on the shared GPIO also switches the fan supply, likely resulting in unintended operation or only power pulsing rather than normal fan PWM control.",
      "confidence": 0.78
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic couples the fan control pin to the same MCU output that drives the fan supply switch. This prevents independent supply switching and fan-speed control on the shown fan connector."
}

